@startuml
!include style.iuml
title AD-6: Progress Monitoring and Delay Detection (WF-12)
|System|
start
:Task or deliverable updated, or scheduled scan starts;
:Recalculate task, sprint, phase and project completion;
:Store progress snapshot;
:List completed, pending, overdue and blocked tasks,\nupcoming deadlines, delayed phases and sprints,\nmembers with excessive workload;
|AI Supervisor|
:Predict risk level and detect tasks that\nendanger dependent tasks;
if (Delay or risk detected?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Send in-app alerts to responsible\nstudents and Team Leader;
  |AI Supervisor|
  :Generate corrective recommendations\n(reassign, adjust deadlines, redistribute workload,\nresolve blockers, revise timeline);
  |System|
  :Store recommendations as open;
  |Team Leader|
  if (Accept recommendation?) then (accept)
    |System|
    :Record decision as accepted;
    :Continue to task assignment or plan adjustment;
  else (dismiss)
    |System|
    :Record decision as dismissed;
  endif
else (no)
endif
|Student, Team Leader and Supervisor|
:View progress, workload and history\naccording to role;
stop
@enduml
